# Raw camera originals are never committed.
#
# The .MOV files straight off the phone carry com.apple.quicktime.location.ISO6709
# (GPS), make/model and capture timestamps, and run ~291 MB. Git history is permanent
# and public once pushed, so a single commit would de-anonymise the submission and
# blow past GitHub's limits (50 MB warning, 100 MB hard block, 1 GB Pages cap).
#
# The transcoded .mp4 files in assets/videos/ ARE tracked: the page needs them to
# serve, they are ~11 MB in total, and ffprobe confirms no location, make, model or
# software tags survive the transcode. Verify any new one before adding it:
#     ffprobe -v error -show_entries format_tags -of default=nw=1 new.mp4
assets/videos/*.MOV
assets/videos/*.mov
assets/videos/impact-multi-task/

# Local scratch
_*.html
*.synctex.gz

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
